oofem.out
Leonhardt and Walther shear beam no. 5, plane stress, CDPM2 crack band, reinforcement as solid steel strip with bond-slip interfaces
NonLinearStatic nmsteps 1 nsteps 1 profileopt 1 nmodules 1 lstype 4 smtype 8 contextoutputstep 1000
nsteps 230 rtolv 1.e-3 stiffMode 2 maxiter 100000 reqiterations 100000 controllmode 0 psi 0.0 hpcmode 2 hpc 2 15 2 hpcw 1 -1 steplength 1.e-5 minsteplength 1.e-5 donotfixload lstype 4 smtype 8 manrmsteps 10
vtkxml primvars 1 1 cellvars 4 1 4 13 27 tstep_step 5 domain_all
domain 2dplanestress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_output {15 4}
4 4 2 0 1
SimpleCS 1 thick 0.19
SimpleCS 2 thick 0.047159
InterfaceCS 3 thickness 0.081681 material 4
SimpleCS 4 thick 0.19
con2dpm 1 d 0 E 30.483e9 n 0.2 talpha 0. wf 59.373e-6 fc 28.5e6 ft 2.247e6 hp 0.01 yieldtol 1.e-6 asoft 15. stype 2 kinit 0.3 ecc 0.518 efc 3.e-5 ahard 8.e-2 bhard 3.3e-3 chard 2. dhard 1.e-6 dilation 0.85
isole 2 d 0 n 0.3 e 200.e9 talpha 0.
isole 3 d 0 n 0.3 e 200.e9 talpha 0.
bondceb 4 kn 4.53e13 ks 4.53e10 s1 1.e-3 s2 2.e-3 s3 8.5e-3 al 0.4 taumax 11.32e6 tauf 4.53e6
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 prescribedvalue 0.0
Nodalload 2 loadTimeFunction 1 components 2 0.0 1.0
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0

# symmetry plane x = 1.275: u_x = 0 (concrete below and above the strip,
# and the steel strip)
vertex 4 5 10 18 20 21
nodeprop bc 2 1 0

curve 4 8 14
nodeprop bc 2 1 0

# support: centre of bottom plate, u_y = 0
vertex 12
nodeprop bc 2 0 1

# load: centre of top plate
vertex 15
nodeprop load 1 2

# concrete
patch 1 2
elemprop crossSect 1 mat 1
triatype trplanestress2d

# reinforcement 2 x d26: steel strip, height 0.022517, thickness 0.047159,
# so that area and moment of inertia equal those of the two bars
patch 3
elemprop crossSect 2 mat 3
triatype trplanestress2d

# steel plates
patch 4 5
elemprop crossSect 4 mat 2
triatype trplanestress2d

# bond along the top and bottom of the strip: intelline1 with the Model Code
# 2010 bond-slip law (bondceb, pull-out, good bond, fck = 20.5 MPa) in the
# tangential direction and the penalty stiffness kn (elastic) in the normal
# direction. Each interface carries half the perimeter of the two bars:
# thickness = pi * 0.052 / 2.
interface 1 2
elemprop crossSect 3 mat 4
quadtype intelline1

###### Used for Extractor
###
#%BEGIN_CHECK%
#LOADLEVEL
#DOFMAN  number 4 dof 2 type d
#DOFMAN  number 15 dof 2 type d
#%END_CHECK%
